  "dn32:0.1": "",
  "dn32:0.2": "",
  "dn32:1.0": "",
  "dn32:1.1": "Evam me sutaṃ. 1. ",
  "dn32:1.2": "Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Rājagahe viharati Gijjhakūṭe pabbate. ",
  "dn32:1.3": "Atha kho cattāro Mahārājā mahatiyā ca Yakkha-senāya mahatiyā ca Gandhabba-senāya mahatiyā ca Kumbhaṇḍa-senāya mahatiyā ca Nāga-senāya, catuddisaṃ rakkhaṃ ṭhapetvā, catuddisaṃ gumbaṃ ṭhapetvā, catuddisaṃ ovaraṇaṃ ṭhapetvā, abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkanta-vaṇṇā kevala-kappaṃ Gijjha-kūṭaṃ obhāsetvā, yena Bhagavā ten' upasaṃkamiṃsu, upasaṃkamitvā Bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu. ",
  "dn32:1.4": "Te pi kho Yakkhā app ekacce Bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu: app ekacce Bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodiṃsu, sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sārāṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu: app ekacce yena Bhagavā ten' añjalim paṇāmetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu: app ekacce nāma-gottaṃ sāvetvā ekamantam nisīdiṃsu: app ekacce tuṇhī-bhūtā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu. 2. ",
  "dn32:2.1": "Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho Vessavaṇo Mahārājā Bhagavantaṃ etad avoca: ",
  "dn32:2.2": "‘Santi hi bhante uḷārā Yakkhā Bhagavato appasannā, ",
  "dn32:2.3": "santi hi bhante uḷārā Yakkhā Bhagavato pasannā: ",
  "dn32:2.4": "santi hi bhante majjhimā Yakkhā Bhagavato appasannā, ",
  "dn32:2.5": "santi hi bhante majjhimā Yakkhā Bhagavato pasannā: ",
  "dn32:2.6": "santi hi bhante nīcā Yakkhā Bhagavato appasannā, ",
  "dn32:2.7": "santi hi bhante nīcā Yakkhā Bhagavato pasannā. ",
  "dn32:2.8": "Yebhuyyena kho pana bhante Yakkhā appasannā yeva Bhagavato. ",
  "dn32:2.9": "Taṃ kissa hetu? ",
  "dn32:2.10": "Bhagavā hi bhante pāṇātipātā veramaṇiyā dhammaṃ deseti, adinnādānā veramaṇiyā dhammaṃ deseti, kāmesu micchācārā veramaṇiyā dhammaṃ deseti, musā-vādā veramaṇiyā dhammaṃ deseti, surā-merayamajja-pamādaṭṭhānā veramaṇiyā dhammaṃ deseti. ",
  "dn32:2.11": "Yebhuyyena kho pana bhante Yakkhā appaṭiviratā yeva pāṇātipātā, appaṭiviratā adinnādānā, appaṭiviratā kāmesu micchācārā, appaṭiviratā musā-vādā, appaṭiviratā surāmeraya-majja-pamādaṭṭhānā. ",
  "dn32:2.12": "Tesaṃ taṃ hoti appiyaṃ amanāpaṃ. ",
  "dn32:2.13": "Santi hi bhante Bhagavato sāvakā, araññe vanapatthāni pantāni senāsanāni paṭisevanti appassaddāni appa-nigghosāni vijana-vātāni manussa-rāhaseyyakāni paṭisallāna-sāruppāni. ",
  "dn32:2.14": "Tattha santi uḷārā Yakkhā nivāsino ye imasmim Bhagavato pāvacane appasannā. ",
  "dn32:2.15": "Tesaṃ pasādāya uggaṇhātu bhante Bhagavā Āṭānāṭiyaṃ rakkhaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ bhikkhunīnaṃ upāsakānaṃ upāsikānaṃ guttiyā rakkhāya avihiṃsāya phāsuvihārāyāti.' ",
  "dn32:2.16": "Adhivāsesi Bhagavā tuṇhi-bhāvena. 3. ",
  "dn32:3.1": "Atha kho Vessavaṇo Mahārājā Bhagavato adhivāsanaṃ viditvā tāyaṃ velāyaṃ imaṃ Āṭānāṭiyaṃ rakkhaṃ abhāsi: ",
  "dn32:3.2": "‘Vipassissa nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.3": "cakkhumantassa sirīmato. ",
  "dn32:3.4": "Sikhissa pi nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.5": "sabba- bhūtānukampino . ",
  "dn32:3.6": "Vessabhussa nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.7": "nahātakassa tapassino. ",
  "dn32:3.8": "Nam' atthu Kakusandhassa ",
  "dn32:3.9": "Māra-senā pamaddino. ",
  "dn32:3.10": "Konāgamanassa nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.11": "brāhmaṇassa vusīmato. ",
  "dn32:3.12": "Kassapassa nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.13": "vippamuttassa sabbadhi. ",
  "dn32:3.14": "Aṅgīrasassa nam' atthu ",
  "dn32:3.15": "Sakya-puttassa sirīmato, ",
  "dn32:3.16": "Yo imaṃ dhammam adesesi ",
  "dn32:3.17": "sabba-dukkhāpanudanaṃ. ",
  "dn32:3.18": "Ye cāpi nibbutā loke ",
  "dn32:3.19": "yathābhūtaṃ vipassisuṃ, ",
  "dn32:3.20": "Te janā apisunā ",
  "dn32:3.21": "mahantā vīta-sāradā. ",
  "dn32:3.22": "Hitaṃ deva-manussānaṃ ",
  "dn32:3.23": "yaṃ namassanti Gotamaṃ ",
  "dn32:3.24": "Vijjā- caraṇa -sampannaṃ. ",
  "dn32:3.25": "mahantaṃ vīta-saradaṃ. 4. ",
  "dn32:4.1": "‘Yato uggacchati suriyo ",
  "dn32:4.2": "ādicco maṇḍalī mahā, ",
  "dn32:4.3": "Yassa c' uggacchamānassa ",
  "dn32:4.4": "saṃvarī pi nirujjhati, ",
  "dn32:4.5": "Yassa c' uggate suriye ",
  "dn32:4.6": "\"Divaso\" ti pavuccati, ",
  "dn32:4.7": "Rahado pi tattha gambhīro ",
  "dn32:4.8": "samuddo saritodako. ",
  "dn32:4.9": "Evan taṃ tattha jānanti ",
  "dn32:4.10": "\"Samuddo saritodako.\" ",
  "dn32:4.11": "Ito \"sā purimā disā\" ",
  "dn32:4.12": "iti naṃ ācikkhatī jano. ",
  "dn32:4.13": "Yaṃ disaṃ abhipāleti ",
  "dn32:4.14": "Mahārājā yassassi so ",
  "dn32:4.15": "Gandhabbānaṃ ādhipati, ",
  "dn32:4.16": "\"Dhataraṭṭho\" iti nāma so, ",
  "dn32:4.17": "Ramati nacca-gītehi ",
  "dn32:4.18": "Gandhabbehi purakkhato. ",
  "dn32:4.19": "Puttā pi tassa bahavo, ",
  "dn32:4.20": "eka-nāmā ti me sutaṃ, ",
  "dn32:4.21": "Asīti dasa eko ca ",
  "dn32:4.22": "Inda-nāmā mahabbalā. ",
  "dn32:4.23": "Te cāpi Buddhaṃ disvāna, ",
  "dn32:4.24": "Buddhaṃ ādicca-bandhunaṃ, ",
  "dn32:4.25": "Dūrato va namassanti ",
  "dn32:4.26": "mahantaṃ vīta-sāradaṃ. ",
  "dn32:4.27": "Namo te purisājañña! ",
  "dn32:4.28": "Namo te purisuttama! ",
  "dn32:4.29": "Kusalena samekkhasi, ",
  "dn32:4.30": "amanussā pi taṃ vadanti! ",
  "dn32:4.31": "Sutaṃ n' etaṃ abhiṇhaso, ",
  "dn32:4.32": "tasmā evaṃ vademase, ",
  "dn32:4.33": "\"Jinaṃ vandatha Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:4.34": "Jinaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:4.35": "Vijjā-caraṇa-sampannaṃ ",
  "dn32:4.36": "Buddhaṃ vadāma Gotamaṃ\" 5. ",
  "dn32:5.1": "‘Yena Petā pavuccanti ",
  "dn32:5.2": "pisuṇā piṭṭhi-maṃsikā ",
  "dn32:5.3": "Pāṇātipātino luddhā ",
  "dn32:5.4": "corā nekatikā janā, ",
  "dn32:5.5": "Ito \"sā dakkhiṇā disā\" ",
  "dn32:5.6": "iti naṃ ācikkhatī jano. ",
  "dn32:5.7": "Yaṃ disaṃ abhipāleti ",
  "dn32:5.8": "Mahārājā yasassi so ",
  "dn32:5.9": "Kumbhaṇḍānaṃ ādhipati, ",
  "dn32:5.10": "\"Virūḷho\" iti nāma so ",
  "dn32:5.11": "Ramati nacca-gītehi, ",
  "dn32:5.12": "Kumbhaṇḍehi purakkhato. ",
  "dn32:5.13": "Puttā pi tassa bahavo ",
  "dn32:5.14": "eka-nāmā ti me sutaṃ, ",
  "dn32:5.15": "Asīti dasa eko ca ",
  "dn32:5.16": "Inda-nāmā mahabbalā. ",
  "dn32:5.17": "Te cāpi Buddhaṃ disvāna, ",
  "dn32:5.18": "Buddhaṃ ādicca-bandhunaṃ, ",
  "dn32:5.19": "Dūrato va namassanti ",
  "dn32:5.20": "mahataṃ vīta-sāradaṃ. ",
  "dn32:5.21": "Namo te purisājañña! ",
  "dn32:5.22": "Namo te purisuttama! ",
  "dn32:5.23": "Kusalena samekkhasi, ",
  "dn32:5.24": "amanussā pi taṃ vandanti! ",
  "dn32:5.25": "Sutaṃ n' etaṃ abhiṇhaso, ",
  "dn32:5.26": "tasmā evaṃ vademase, ",
  "dn32:5.27": "\"Jinaṃ vadatha Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:5.28": "Jinaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:5.29": "Vijjā-caraṇa-sampannaṃ ",
  "dn32:5.30": "Buddhaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ.\" 6. ",
  "dn32:6.1": "‘Yattha c' oggacchati suriyo ",
  "dn32:6.2": "ādicco maṇḍalī mahā, ",
  "dn32:6.3": "Yassa c' oggacchamānassa ",
  "dn32:6.4": "divaso pi nirujjhati, ",
  "dn32:6.5": "Yassa c' oggate suriye \" ",
  "dn32:6.6": "Saṃvarī \" ti pavuccati, ",
  "dn32:6.7": "Rahado pi tattha gambhīro ",
  "dn32:6.8": "samuddo saritodako. ",
  "dn32:6.9": "Evan taṃ tattha jānanti ",
  "dn32:6.10": "\"Samuddo saritodako.\" ",
  "dn32:6.11": "Ito \"sā pacchimā disā\" ",
  "dn32:6.12": "iti naṃ acikkhatī jano. ",
  "dn32:6.13": "Yaṃ disaṃ abhipāleti ",
  "dn32:6.14": "Mahārājā yasassi so ",
  "dn32:6.15": "Nāgānaṃ ādhipati, ",
  "dn32:6.16": "\"Virūpakkho\" iti nāma so ",
  "dn32:6.17": "Ramati nacca-gītehi, ",
  "dn32:6.18": "Nāgehi purakkhato. ",
  "dn32:6.19": "Puttā pi tassa bahavo ",
  "dn32:6.20": "eka-nāmā ti me sutaṃ, ",
  "dn32:6.21": "Asīti dasa eko ca ",
  "dn32:6.22": "Inda-nāmā mahabbalā. ",
  "dn32:6.23": "Te cāpi Buddhaṃ disvāna, ",
  "dn32:6.24": "Buddhaṃ ādicca-bandhunaṃ, ",
  "dn32:6.25": "Dūrato va namassanti ",
  "dn32:6.26": "mahantaṃ vīta-sāradaṃ. ",
  "dn32:6.27": "Namo te purisājañña! ",
  "dn32:6.28": "Namo te purisuttama! ",
  "dn32:6.29": "Kusalena samekkhasi, ",
  "dn32:6.30": "amanussā pi taṃ vandanti! ",
  "dn32:6.31": "Sutaṃ n' etaṃ abhiṇhaso, ",
  "dn32:6.32": "tasmā evaṃ vademase, ",
  "dn32:6.33": "\"Jinaṃ vandatha Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:6.34": "Jinaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:6.35": "Vijjā-caraṇa-sampannaṃ ",
  "dn32:6.36": "Buddhaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ.\" 7. ",
  "dn32:7.1": "‘Yena Uttara-kurū rammā ",
  "dn32:7.2": "Mahā-Neru sudassano ",
  "dn32:7.3": "Manussā tattha jāyanti ",
  "dn32:7.4": "amamā apariggahā. ",
  "dn32:7.5": "Na te bījaṃ pavapanti, ",
  "dn32:7.6": "na pi nīyanti naṅgalā, ",
  "dn32:7.7": "Akaṭṭha-pākimaṃ sāliṃ ",
  "dn32:7.8": "paribhuñjanti mānusā. ",
  "dn32:7.9": "Akaṇaṃ athusaṃ suddhaṃ ",
  "dn32:7.10": "sugandhaṃ taṇḍula-pphalaṃ ",
  "dn32:7.11": "Tuṇḍi-kīre pacitvāna, ",
  "dn32:7.12": "tato bhuñjati bhojanaṃ. ",
  "dn32:7.13": "Gāvim eka-khuraṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.14": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.15": "Pasuṃ eka-khuraṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.16": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.17": "Itthī-vāhanaṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.18": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.19": "Purisa-vāhanaṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.20": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.21": "Kumāri-vāhanaṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.22": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.23": "Kumāra-vāhanaṃ katvā ",
  "dn32:7.24": "anuyanti diso disaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.25": "Te yāne abhirūhitvā ",
  "dn32:7.26": "sabbā disā anupariyanti ",
  "dn32:7.27": "Pacārā tassa rājino. ",
  "dn32:7.28": "Hatthi-yānaṃ assa-yānaṃ ",
  "dn32:7.29": "dibbaṃ yānaṃ upaṭṭhitaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.30": "Pāsādā sivikā c' eva ",
  "dn32:7.31": "Mahārājassa yasassino. ",
  "dn32:7.32": "Tassa ca nagarā ahu ",
  "dn32:7.33": "antalikkhe sumāpitā, ",
  "dn32:7.34": "Āṭānāṭā Kusināṭā Parakusināṭā ",
  "dn32:7.35": "Nāṭapuriyā Parakusitanāṭā. ",
  "dn32:7.36": "Uttarena Kapīvanto, ",
  "dn32:7.37": "Janogham aparena ca, ",
  "dn32:7.38": "Navanatiyo Ambara-Ambaravatiyo, ",
  "dn32:7.39": "Āḷakamandā nāma rāja-dhāni. ",
  "dn32:7.40": "Kuverassa kho pana Mārisa, ",
  "dn32:7.41": "Mahārājassa Visāṇā nāma rāja-dhāni. ",
  "dn32:7.42": "Tasmā Kuvero Mahārājā ",
  "dn32:7.43": "\"Vessavaṇo\" ti pavuccati. ",
  "dn32:7.44": "Paccesanto pakāsenti ",
  "dn32:7.45": "Tatolā Tattalā Tatotalā ",
  "dn32:7.46": "Ojasi Tejasi Tatojasi ",
  "dn32:7.47": "Sūro rājā Ariṭṭho Nemi. ",
  "dn32:7.48": "Rahado pi tattha Dharanī nāma ",
  "dn32:7.49": "yato meghā pavassanti, ",
  "dn32:7.50": "Vassā yato patāyanti. ",
  "dn32:7.51": "Sabhā pi tattha Bhagalavati nāma ",
  "dn32:7.52": "yattha Yakkhā payirupāsanti. ",
  "dn32:7.53": "Tattha nicca-phalā rukkhā ",
  "dn32:7.54": "nānā-dija-gaṇāyutā ",
  "dn32:7.55": "Mayūra-koñcābhirudā Jīvaṃ ",
  "dn32:7.56": "jīvaka-sadd' ",
  "dn32:7.57": "ettha ",
  "dn32:7.58": "atho oṭṭhava-cittakā ",
  "dn32:7.59": "Kukutthakā kulīrakā ",
  "dn32:7.60": "vane pokkhara-sātakā. Suka-sāḷika-sadd' ",
  "dn32:7.61": "ettha ",
  "dn32:7.62": "daṇḍa-mānavakāni ca, ",
  "dn32:7.63": "Sobhati sabba-kālaṃ sā ",
  "dn32:7.64": "Kuvera-nalinī sadā. ",
  "dn32:7.65": "Ito \"sā uttarā disa\" ",
  "dn32:7.66": "iti naṃ ācikkhatī jano. ",
  "dn32:7.67": "Yaṃ disaṃ abhipāleti, ",
  "dn32:7.68": "Magārājā yasassi so ",
  "dn32:7.69": "Yakkhānaṃ ādhipati, ",
  "dn32:7.70": "\"Kuvero\" iti nāma so ",
  "dn32:7.71": "Ramati nacca-gītehi, ",
  "dn32:7.72": "yakkhehi purakkhato. ",
  "dn32:7.73": "Puttā pi tassa bahavo ",
  "dn32:7.74": "eka-nāmā ti me sutaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.75": "Asīti dasa eko ca ",
  "dn32:7.76": "Inda-nāmā mahabbalā. ",
  "dn32:7.77": "Te cāpi Buddhaṃ disvāna, ",
  "dn32:7.78": "Buddhaṃ ādicca-bandhunaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.79": "Dūrato va namassanti ",
  "dn32:7.80": "mahantaṃ vītā-sāradaṃ. ",
  "dn32:7.81": "Namo te purisājañña! ",
  "dn32:7.82": "Namo te purisuttama! ",
  "dn32:7.83": "Kusalena samekkhasi ",
  "dn32:7.84": "amanussā pi taṃ vadanti! ",
  "dn32:7.85": "Sutaṃ n' etaṃ abhiṇhaso , ",
  "dn32:7.86": "tasmā evaṃ vademase, ",
  "dn32:7.87": "\"Jinaṃ vandatha Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.88": "Jinaṃ vandāma Gotamaṃ, ",
  "dn32:7.89": "Vijjā-caraṇa-sampannaṃ ",
  "dn32:7.90": "Buddhaṃ vandāma Gotaman\" ti.' 8. ",
  "dn32:8.1": "‘Ayaṃ kho sā Mārisa Āṭānāṭiyā rakkhā bhikkhūnaṃ bhikkhunīnaṃ upāsakānaṃ upāsikānaṃ guttiyā rakkhāya avihiṃsāya phāsu-vihārayāti.' ",
  "dn32:8.2": "‘Yassa kassaci Mārisa bhikkhussa vā bhikkhuniyā vā upāsakassa vā upāsikāya ayaṃ Āṭānāṭiyā rakkhā suggahitā bhavissati samattā pariyāputā, ",
  "dn32:8.3": "tañ ce amanusso Yakkho vā Yakkhinī vā Yakkha-potako vā Yakkha-potikā vā Yakkha-mahāmatto vā Yakkha-pārisajjo vā Yakkhapacāro vā, Gandhabbo vā Gandhabbī vā . . . pe . . . Kumbhaṇḍo vā . . . pe . . . Nāgo vā . . . pe . . . paduṭṭha-citto bhikkhuṃ vā bhikkhuniṃ vā upāsakaṃ vā upāsikaṃ vā gacchantaṃ vā anugaccheyya, ṭhitaṃ vā upatiṭṭheyya, nisinnaṃ vā upanisīdeyya, nipannaṃ vā upanipajjeyya, ",
  "dn32:8.4": "na me so Mārisa amanusso labheyya gāmesu vā nigamesu vā sakkāraṃ vā garu-kāraṃ vā. ",
  "dn32:8.5": "Na me so Mārisa amanusso labheyya Āḷakamandāya rāja-dhāniyā vatthuṃ vā vāsaṃ vā. ",
  "dn32:8.6": "Na me so Mārisa amanusso labheyya Yakkhānaṃ samitiṃ gantuṃ ",
  "dn32:8.7": "Api ssu naṃ Mārisa amanussā anāvayham pi naṃ kareyyuṃ avivayhaṃ. ",
